# Nothing from the upstream checkout belongs in the packaging build context:
# whether a build uses the from-source Dockerfile (context = upstream source) or
# the release Dockerfile (context = this repository) is decided by the caller,
# but a stray node_modules or dist from your machine must never be baked in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-engine
**/.git
**/e2e-out
**/tests
*.log
.DS_Store
